Verdict: SUPPORTED
Rationale: The claim states that Mazda is not the manufacturer of the car used as design inspiration for the platform shared by the Ford Escape and Tribute. The evidence shows that the Ford CD2 platform was jointly developed with Mazda and that the Mazda Tribute is a rebadged variant of the Ford Escape. This supports the claim that Mazda is not the original manufacturer of the design inspiration for the platform.
